{"id": "dlss5-nr-video-gui-05c20322", "revision": 0, "last_node_id": 7, "last_link_id": 5, "nodes": [{"id": 5, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [-640, 220], "size": [560, 1140], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "使用说明", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["# DLSS5 神经渲染 · 视频材质增强（GUI 完整版）\n\n**链路**：`VHS_LoadVideo（上传视频）→ DLSS5EnhanceImages（逐帧神经渲染+时序累积）→ CreateVideo（图像+原音轨合帧）→ SaveVideo（出 mp4）`\n\n**全连线已接好，打开后两步**：\n1. `VHS_LoadVideo` 选/上传视频（H3 成片拷进 ComfyUI 输入目录，或点上传）\n2. Queue → 成片落在输出目录 `DLSS5_NR_video_*`，**原音轨自动保留**\n\n## 三档现成配方（DLSS5 Settings 节点）\n| 场景 | nr_style | intensity | structure | skin | preset |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 人物/猫特写（皮肤毛发优先） | Natural | 1.0 | 1.5~1.7 | 2.0 | M |\n| 整段自然增强（H3 成片） | Natural | 1.0 | 1.2~1.5 | 1.5 | L |\n| 出蜡感/浮雕感的退烧组合 | Natural | 0.7~0.8 | 1.0 | 1.0~1.5 | L 或 K |\n\n## 逐参数说明（DLSS5 Settings）\n- **upscaling_mode**：`1x`=只增强；1.5x/2x/3x=顺便放大（AI 素材更建议出片后走 RTXVSR）。\n- **nr_preset**：各档实测几乎一致，不用动。\n- **nr_style**：Natural 贴原图（推荐）；Cinematic 易过塑。\n- **nr_intensity**：**>1.0 无额外效果**；太重降到 0.7~0.85。\n- **local_tone_strength**：保持 1.0。\n- **local_structure_strength**：材质主旋钮。糊→1.7；浮雕感→1.0~1.2。\n- **skin_structure + automatic_mask**：**mask 关则 skin 无效**。人物→2.0；塑料感→1.5。\n- **dlss_model_preset**：L/M 最强；M 过度加工退 L/K。\n\n调参一次只动一个：皮肤→skin+preset；整体→structure±0.3；最后才 intensity。\n\n## 本工作流专属参数\n- **frame_load_cap**：0=整段加载。**先填 24~48 只跑前几秒预览**，满意改 0 跑整段（短视频内存无忧，长视频请改用文件级工作流）。\n- **CreateVideo.fps**：默认 24（H3 标准帧率）。源视频帧率不同必须改成对应值，否则音画变速。\n- **SaveVideo.format**：`auto`（自动选 MP4 容器，可选 mp4/mkv/webm）；`codec=auto`；`filename_prefix`=输出文件名前缀。\n\n## 两条视频管线的取舍\n| 版本 | 适用 | 特点 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 本工作流（GUI 完整版） | H3 这类 5~10 秒短片 | 界面上传、音轨自动保留、全链路可视化 |\n| `DLSS5_视频材质增强_工作流_20260914.json`（文件级） | 长视频 | DLSS5EnhanceVideoFile 流式处理不占大内存，video_path 手填绝对路径 |\n\n## 注意\n- 神经渲染只在 8-bit SDR 上运行，HDR 素材高光会裁切（H3 出片一般是 SDR，不受影响）。\n- 相同输入命中缓存，重复提交不重算。\n- 想同时放大：在 ③ Enhance Images 之后接 RTXVSR / 4x-UltraSharp 再进 CreateVideo。\n"]}, {"id": 1, "type": "VHS_LoadVideo", "pos": [0, 240], "size": [360, 528], "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0, "title": "① 选择/上传视频", "inputs": [{"localized_name": "meta_batch", "name": "meta_batch", "shape": 7, "type": "VHS_BatchManager", "link": null}, {"localized_name": "vae", "name": "vae", "shape": 7, "type": "VAE", "link": null}, {"localized_name": "video", "name": "video", "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "video"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "force_rate", "name": "force_rate", "type": "FLOAT", "widget": {"name": "force_rate"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "custom_width", "name": "custom_width", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "custom_width"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "custom_height", "name": "custom_height", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "custom_height"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "frame_load_cap", "name": "frame_load_cap", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "frame_load_cap"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "skip_first_frames", "name": "skip_first_frames", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "skip_first_frames"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "select_every_nth", "name": "select_every_nth", "type": "INT", "widget": {"name": "select_every_nth"}, "link": null}, {"localized_name": "format", "name": "format", "shape": 7, "type": "COMBO", "widget": {"name": "format"}, "link": null}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "IMAGE", "name": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1]}, {"localized_name": "frame_count", "name": "frame_count", "type": "INT", "slot_index": 1, "links": []}, {"localized_name": "audio", "name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "slot_index": 2, "links": [2]}, {"localized_name": "video_info", "name": "video_info", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "slot_index": 3, "links": []}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VHS_LoadVideo"}, "widgets_values": {"video": "", "force_rate": 0, "custom_width": 0, "custom_height": 0, "frame_load_cap": 0, "skip_first_frames": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "format": "AnimateDif